        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimmy Hoffa, Danny DeVito, David Mamet, Jack Nicholson, John Joseph Nicholson, Robert Ciaro\n- Works: Hoffa\n- Organizations: Teamsters\n- Topics: biographical crime films, acting, filmmaking\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Nicholson was born as John Joseph Nicholson on April 22, 1937.\n- John Joseph Nicholson is an American actor and filmmaker who has performed for over 60 years.\n- Hoffa is a 1992 French-American biographical crime film based on the life of Teamsters leader Jimmy Hoffa.\n- Hoffa was directed by Danny DeVito and written by David Mamet.\n- In Hoffa, Jack Nicholson plays Jimmy Hoffa.\n- In Hoffa, Danny DeVito plays Robert Ciaro, a character created as an amalgamation of several Jimmy Hoffa associates over the years.",
